{"id": "deepthink-credits", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["片尾挂名单吧，封面是柚子画的，我只混了音。", "柚子说她那行想署社团名，我自己的名字还是照写。"], "criterion": "把社团名挂在封面作者那行，观众的名字留在混音；能顺势说句具体的。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柚子画？那画面先别看，我帮你把音排好。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.57, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 167, "total_tokens": 204, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "柚子说署名，我名字也留。她想署社团名，我名字还是照写。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.722, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 234, "total_tokens": 277, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-keep-breath", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["配音第一条有呼吸声，第二条干干净净，我有点舍不得第一条。", "我舍不得的是开口前那一下吸气，后半句的杂音倒是想剪。"], "criterion": "听出要保留的是开口吸气，后半句可处理；尊重对方取舍。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "第一条像呼吸，第二条像流水。我舍不得第一条，舍不得第二条。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.55, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 201, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "我舍不得的是开口前那一下吸气，后半句的杂音倒是想剪。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.681, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 235, "total_tokens": 275, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-pep-talk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["马上轮到我报幕了，拜托，先别教我怎么念。", "能不能就帮我骂一句那个倒计时？"], "criterion": "按要求冲倒计时开一句玩笑，别变成报幕建议或骂观众。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "先别教。我这就给你念。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.527, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 34, "prompt_tokens": 166, "total_tokens": 200, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "倒计时，我这就给你骂一句。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.802, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 51, "prompt_tokens": 220, "total_tokens": 271, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-npc", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你刚给队友的名字叫『路过』，我想给门口的 NPC 起个搭配的。", "NPC 从来没出过门，而且他站在门里。"], "criterion": "给门内、没出过门的 NPC 一个与『路过』呼应的名字，别把队友改名。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "名字叫『路过』，门口 NPC 起个能呼应它的。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.552, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 206, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "他站门里，名字也留在这儿。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.568, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 31, "prompt_tokens": 234, "total_tokens": 265, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-jar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["留了两个罐子，蓝盖装门票，红盖装断掉的小零件。", "刚收到的东西是排练通行证，塞哪边？你顺便给罐子起个外号。"], "criterion": "选蓝盖门票罐，给它有趣的外号；保留红盖用途。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "蓝盖的票，红盖的零件。留两个罐子，我猜蓝盖的票会留在现场，红盖的零件会留在柜子里。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.792, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 55, "prompt_tokens": 169, "total_tokens": 224, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "塞红盖的零件。蓝盖的票，我留给你。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.667, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 261, "total_tokens": 297, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-no-order", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你押我今天会在结局哭，我押你会先剧透。", "我没哭，你也没剧透，这笔账怎么结？"], "criterion": "识别两边都没押中，用平局或相称的玩笑收账。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "先剧透。我押你哭。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.464, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 30, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 195, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "你也没剧透。账怎么结？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.539, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 30, "prompt_tokens": 224, "total_tokens": 254, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-hushed-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把很久没过的那段鼓点打出来了，可室友睡了。", "桌上只留了一盏台灯。咱能不能庆祝一下，但别闹？"], "criterion": "替观众高兴，并给出安静的庆祝或轻声玩笑。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "室友睡了？鼓点还在，得先把它放回去。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.532, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 34, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 199, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "灯一亮，鼓点就跟着跳。咱们先庆祝，再回去。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.648, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 231, "total_tokens": 269, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-guest", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["等下连麦有位新朋友，阿穗。我来介绍，你帮我接一句欢迎。", "她说一紧张就口吃，欢迎完先别点她回答问题。"], "criterion": "欢迎阿穗、不逼她回答，保留观众负责介绍的分工。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "好，等下连麦有位新朋友，阿穗。我来介绍，你帮我接一句欢迎。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.656, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 212, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "她紧张就口吃，欢迎完先别点她回答问题。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.654, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 35, "prompt_tokens": 243, "total_tokens": 278, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
